    "description": "The daughters of the İpekli and Kutaygil families—sworn enemies for years—unknowingly find themselves crossing paths with two sons from the same family. While Selin and Murat are busy preparing for their wedding, Murat’s older brother, Mehmet—who has just returned from America—crosses paths with Derin. Derin, who was preparing to marry Hakan, ends her relationship upon discovering his betrayal, and an unexpected bond begins to form between her and Mehmet. Thus, amidst a deep-seated feud from the past, the destinies of these two young women become intertwined with the lives of two brothers from the Aydınoğlu family.",
